"""Short Persian explanations for common workflow errors.

The patterns live in ``config.json`` (branch ``config``, key ``error_help``)
so they can be edited without a build; ``DEFAULT_PATTERNS`` is the copy built
into the app for when that file cannot be read. Each pattern:

    {"id": "...", "match": ["text", "re:regex", ...],   # any one matches
     "title": "...", "tip": "..."}                      # Persian

Matching is case-insensitive on the error text; patterns are tried in order
and the first ``MAX_MATCHES`` matches are shown.
"""
